name 'iterating-with-ai-preassessment-q15_2025'

question 'What is findability in the context of user design?'

wrong 'The ability for the AI to find errors in your code automatically.'
wrong 'A tool that finds where the developer saved their files on the computer.'
right 'How easily a user can locate the specific information they need within a web app.'
wrong 'A type of loop that searches for the largest number in an array.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 11

Findability is a key part of human-centered design. Using filters, search, and clear labels helps ensure users don't get lost in large datasets.
MARKDOWN
